{"id":"b5kvt8ipemgb3bzq9l594kvjj","title":"MAUDE-Py：CRISPR 筛选分析工具的 Python 实现与性能提升","originalTitle":"MAUDE-Py: A Python Implementation for Analyzing Sorting-Based Pooled CRISPR Screens","summary":"Agarwal 和 Moy 开发了 MAUDE-Py 工具，用于分析 CRISPR 群体筛选数据。该工具在速度上比原始 R 语言 MAUDE 平台快2.09至4.19倍，同时保持分析一致性。主要改进包括自动化基线计算、增强型非编码元件显著性检测方法，以及集成可视化套件。测试数据集验证了其准确性和实用性，为生物信息学工作提供高效替代方案。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"bioRxiv"},"links":{"original":"https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.64898/2026.11.12.766045v1?rss=1"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T18:48:12.813Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T18:48:12.813Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","CRISPR","OpenAI"],"score":56,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e9f86467-b363-4e91-aa7d-6d98b6488905","title":"Agarwal与Moy发布MAUDE-Py CRISPR分析工具"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":" Agarwal, A., Moy, J. L. ","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e9f86467-b363-4e91-aa7d-6d98b6488905","title":"Agarwal与Moy发布MAUDE-Py CRISPR分析工具"}],"topics":[{"slug":"openai","name":"OpenAI"},{"slug":"gene-editing","name":"基因编辑与 CRISPR"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fQBIsYJJEOdk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}